include README.md LICENSE.md
recursive-include licenses *
recursive-include schemas *.json
recursive-include docs *.md *.json
include tools/__init__.py tools/build_html_css.py tools/capture_baseline.py tools/capture_platform_layout.py tools/font_geometry.py tools/compare_font_platforms.py tools/calibrate_pdf_geometry.py
